# The additional cost is mandatory: with only lands in play Deadly Dispute is refused even with its {1}{B} on offer (CR 601.2b,
# 118.3: a player can't pay a cost they can't pay). Once an Ornithopter is in play the same cast is legal (the control) and
# sacrifices it: two cards are drawn and a Treasure token is made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Ornithopter
Deadly Dispute
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Deadly Dispute.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deadly Dispute.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Deadly Dispute; Ornithopter
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Treasure Token
